*.tsbuildinfo
services/api/prisma/*.db
services/api/prisma/*.db-journal
services/api/prisma/dev.db*
# Prisma resolves a relative sqlite `file:` URL relative to schema.prisma's own
# directory, i.e. services/api/prisma/, so a DATABASE_URL of "file:./prisma/dev.db"
# actually lands one level deeper than it looks (prisma/prisma/dev.db) — cover
# that nesting explicitly, since the pattern above alone missed it.
services/api/prisma/**/*.db
services/api/prisma/**/*.db-journal
data/
storage/
services/api/backups/
services/api/.before-restore/
.DS_Store
.turbo/
